# Everything is normalized to LF so a Windows, macOS and Linux clone agree.
# This rule comes first because the last matching rule wins, and the exceptions
# below override it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep vendored build artifacts byte-identical.
#
# `vendor/channel-pack/NOTICE.md` publishes a checksum for `pack.js`, and the
# WASM module is loaded by path: a line-ending conversion would change the bytes
# on checkout and make the documented md5 look like tampering.
vendor/channel-pack/pack.js  -text
vendor/channel-pack/*.wasm   binary
